          },
          "content": [
           {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Hepatic: aSx ↑aminotransferases or hepatic steatosis · acute hepatitis (abd pain · jaundice · ↑aminotransferases) · acute liver failure · chronic hepatitis · cirrhosis"
